    en: { title: 'Best Wireless Earbuds for the Office', description: 'Wireless earbuds well suited for office use, favoring transparency mode and comfort for long workdays.', intro: 'Office use often benefits more from transparency mode than pure ANC — hearing a colleague or a meeting notification without removing an earbud matters day to day.', sections: [['Transparency over isolation', 'A transparency mode that sounds natural is often more useful in an office than maximum noise cancellation.'], ['Comfort for long days', 'Weight and fit matter more when earbuds are worn for a full workday rather than a single commute.'], ['Compare the shortlist', 'Use the candidates below as a starting point, then check full specifications on each product page.']] },
